    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/waE9ACf4p9b5YuvFIu57YnpiZxKO-xE0OF17PLg86ag.original.fullsize.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\text { area } \\int_1^2\\left(\\frac{1}{x}-\\frac{a}{x^2}\\right) d x \\\\ & {\\left[\\ell n x+\\frac{a}{x}\\right]_1^2} \\\\ & \\ell \\operatorname{nn} 2+\\frac{a}{2}-a=\\log _e 2-\\frac{1}{7} \\\\ & \\frac{-a}{2}=-\\frac{1}{7} \\\\ & a=\\frac{2}{7} \\\\ & 7 a=2 \\\\ & 7 a-3=-1\\end{aligned}$",
